    ('A2', 7, 'Organize as palavras para formar uma frase: "They were at the hotel."', ARRAY['They', 'were', 'at', 'the', 'hotel']::text[], 'They were at the hotel', 'A ordem correta é "They were at the hotel.".', 'Were é o passado de be com you, we e they.'),
